  "title": "Green Apple, Jicama, and Prawn Salad with Mint, Lemongrass, and Dijon Dressing",
  "description": "Thin strips of green apple, jicama, and carrots are tossed with shrimp and a bright, minty, Asian-inspired dressing made with fresh lemongrass and garlic.",
